(Bharat Uday Finserve \(BUFL\) - Frequently Asked Questions) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Who is eligible for each loan type?) Tj
T*
(School proprietors can apply for school improvement loans, parents can apply for) Tj
T*
(school fee finance, students with confirmed admission can apply for student or) Tj
T*
(overseas education loans, and learners enrolled with eligible training partners can) Tj
T*
(apply for vocational and skills loans.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. What documents are required to apply?) Tj
T*
(Typical documents include Aadhaar, PAN, address proof, bank statements, income proof,) Tj
T*
(admission or fee documents, and school or course details. School loans may also) Tj
T*
(require registration, fee collection, and operating records.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. What are the interest rates and repayment terms?) Tj
T*
(Rates and tenures depend on product type, borrower profile, loan amount, and credit) Tj
T*
(assessment. BUFL shares the applicable rate, EMI, fees, and repayment schedule before) Tj
T*
(sanction.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. How long does the approval process take?) Tj
T*
(Fee finance and skill loans may move in 48-72 hours once documents are complete.) Tj
T*
(Student, overseas, and school improvement loans can take longer depending on) Tj
T*
(verification and underwriting.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Can schools apply for the School Growth Program?) Tj
T*
(Yes. Affordable private schools can express interest in the School Growth Program,) Tj
T*
(especially if they are ready for a structured 3-year improvement journey across) Tj
T*
(capital, capability, and community.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Is there a moratorium period for student loans?) Tj
T*
(Eligible student loans may include a moratorium during the course period, subject to) Tj
T*
(loan structure, institution, co-applicant profile, and final sanction terms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. How is the loan disbursed?) Tj
T*
(Disbursal can be made directly to the school, college, university, training provider,) Tj
T*
(or borrower account depending on the approved product, fee schedule, and compliance) Tj
T*
(requirements.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. What makes BUFL different from traditional banks?) Tj
T*
(BUFL combines education-first underwriting, local relationship support, digital) Tj
T*
(workflows, and value enhancement programs so funding is connected to measurable) Tj
T*
(learning outcomes.) Tj
T*
